# Optional shared third-party dependencies for AI services
# Reviewed: 2026-11-23 (Asia/Singapore)
# Mixed official/community candidates for login, captcha,
# payment, support, telemetry or uploads. Not all are required by every client.
# Adding them to an AI policy will also divert non-AI traffic.
# Do not expand these to root domains such as googleapis.com, cloudflare.com,
# stripe.com, auth0.com, amazonaws.com, or facebook.com.

# ===== OpenAI / ChatGPT official shared allowlist =====
# https://help.openai.com/en/articles/9247338-network-recommendations-for-chatgpt-errors-on-web-and-apps
# Login / enterprise SSO (WorkOS)
DOMAIN,cdn.workos.com
DOMAIN,forwarder.workos.com
DOMAIN,frontend-apps-multi-region.workos.com
DOMAIN,images.workoscdn.com
DOMAIN,setup.workos.com
DOMAIN,workos.imgix.net
# Support chat (Intercom). DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercom.io will catch all Intercom customers.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercom.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercomcdn.com
# Payment
DOMAIN,js.stripe.com
# Cloudflare bot challenge (shared)
DOMAIN,challenges.cloudflare.com
# Email click tracking
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ct.sendgrid.net
# Apple device attestation / App Attest
DOMAIN,humb.apple.com
DOMAIN,register.appattest.apple.com
# Telemetry / error reporting (OpenAI-specific Sentry projects; Datadog is shared)
DOMAIN,o207216.ingest.sentry.io
DOMAIN,o33249.ingest.sentry.io
DOMAIN,o33249.ingest.us.sentry.io
DOMAIN,rum.browser-intake-datadoghq.com
DOMAIN,browser-intake-datadoghq.com
# Community: Arkose captcha, Statsig feature flags, Qualtrics surveys, LiveKit TURN (shared)
DOMAIN,openai-api.arkoselabs.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,client-api.arkoselabs.com
DOMAIN,api.statsig.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,featuregates.org
DOMAIN,openai.qualtrics.com
DOMAIN,host.livekit.cloud
DOMAIN,turn.livekit.cloud

# ===== Anthropic / Claude official third-party egress =====
# https://code.claude.com/docs/en/network-config
# Plugin / installer metadata and older updater CDN (shared Google Cloud Storage)
DOMAIN,storage.googleapis.com
# Plugin and npm installs (shared)
DOMAIN,registry.npmjs.org
# Official marketplace / changelog (shared GitHub)
DOMAIN,github.com
DOMAIN,raw.githubusercontent.com
DOMAIN,objects.githubusercontent.com
# Optional official telemetry (disableable in Claude Code)
DOMAIN,http-intake.logs.us5.datadoghq.com
DOMAIN,browser-intake-us5-datadoghq.com
DOMAIN,ingest.us.sentry.io
# Community / X discussion of Statsig + Sift risk controls (not official allowlist entries)
# https://x.com/LanzhiAI/status/2123344781115879540 (2026-11-19)
# https://x.com/LanzhiAI/status/2124133729602073031 (2026-11-21)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,statsigapi.net
# SSO / cloud provider hosts if using Console login or Bedrock/Vertex/Foundry
DOMAIN,login.microsoftonline.com
DOMAIN,oauth2.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,accounts.google.com
DOMAIN,sts.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,iamcredentials.googleapis.com

# ===== Google Gemini official firewall shared Google hosts =====
# https://knowledge.workspace.google.com/admin/generative-ai/gemini-app/gemini-app-firewall-settings
# These also serve Search, YouTube, Maps, fonts, ads, and Workspace.
# isteed-AI.conf incorrectly uses DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googleapis.com; do not copy that.
DOMAIN,www.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,apis.google.com
DOMAIN,ssl.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,www.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,fonts.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,fonts.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,lh3.googleusercontent.com
DOMAIN,lh5.googleusercontent.com
DOMAIN,lh3.google.com
DOMAIN,ogs.google.com
DOMAIN,play.google.com
DOMAIN,www.google.com
DOMAIN,maps.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,maps.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,jnn-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,waa-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,content-autofill.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,optimizationguide-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,streetviewpixels-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,csp.withgoogle.com
DOMAIN,encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com
# Official list also names YouTube / ads / analytics; keep them out of an AI policy
# unless you deliberately want that traffic on the same egress:
# www.youtube.com, i.ytimg.com, yt3.ggpht.com, www.googletagmanager.com,
# www.google-analytics.com, static.doubleclick.net, td.doubleclick.net,
# googleads.g.doubleclick.net, ogads-pa.clients6.google.com
# Antigravity enterprise also allowlists general Vertex / Discovery Engine:
# https://antigravity.google/docs/enterprise/
DOMAIN,aiplatform.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,aiplatform.us.rep.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,aiplatform.eu.rep.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,aiplatform.mtls.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,discoveryengine.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,us-discoveryengine.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,eu-discoveryengine.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,discoveryengine.mtls.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,us-discoveryengine.mtls.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,eu-discoveryengine.mtls.googleapis.com

# ===== xAI / Grok official additional / installer =====
