# CLI curl|bash installer fallback CDN (shared)
# DOMAIN,storage.googleapis.com  (already listed under Anthropic)
# Enterprise OIDC example in the same doc: login.microsoftonline.com (already listed)

# Perplexity-specific upload/media hosts moved to ai.list.
