# ===== Microsoft Copilot official app allowlist (update + sign-in only) =====
# https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/plan/add-copilot-endpoints-allowlist
# Updated 2026-11-04. Chat hosts are NOT in this article.
# Update service / Edge delivery (shared with Microsoft Edge)
DOMAIN,msedge.api.cdp.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,config.edge.skype.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,dl.delivery.mp.microsoft.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,do.dsp.mp.microsoft.com
# Sign-in for MSA and Entra ID (shared with almost all Microsoft products)
DOMAIN,login.live.com
DOMAIN,login.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,login.windows.net
DOMAIN,odc.officeapps.live.com
DOMAIN,cdn.odc.officeapps.live.com
DOMAIN,graph.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,substrate.office.com
DOMAIN,privacy.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,logincdn.msauth.net
# Do not add www.bing.com (blackmatrix7 / isteed do; it captures all Bing Search)

# ===== GitHub Copilot official shared GitHub / Azure / experimentation =====
# https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/reference/copilot-allowlist-reference
DOMAIN,api.github.com
DOMAIN,github.githubassets.com
DOMAIN,avatars.githubusercontent.com
DOMAIN,collector.github.com
DOMAIN,default.exp-tas.com
# Copilot-specific Azure Web PubSub hosts are in ai.list.
# Fallback report downloads (shared Azure Front Door / Blob)
# copilot-reports-*.b01.azurefd.net and usagereports*.blob.core.windows.net
# are wildcard Azure hosts; left out of formal DOMAIN rules, see unverified-and-excluded.md

# Cursor-specific binary downloads moved to ai.list.
# WorkOS is listed by jinxinkai as DOMAIN-SUFFIX,workos.com (too broad).
# Official Cursor network doc names Cursor hosts; WorkOS appears on OpenAI's list.
# Binary downloads (community, dler-io):
# Authenticator fallback authenticator.cursor.sh is covered by DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cursor.sh

# ===== Windsurf official auth (over-broad if suffix is used) =====
# https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/devin-desktop-faq
# Official text allowlists .googleapis.com and apis.google.com for authentication.
# Only the specific host is safe-ish; do not add DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googleapis.com

# ===== Kimi web telemetry observed on official homepage HTML =====
# https://www.kimi.com/ (fetched 2026-11-23) references apmplus.volces.com
# That is Volcengine APM, shared observability, not Kimi-exclusive.
DOMAIN,apmplus.volces.com

# Shared Bing endpoints from community research; optional for Copilot
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,edgeservices.bing.com
DOMAIN,services.bingapis.com
DOMAIN,r.bing.com
